{
  "start": "-P1D",
  "periodOverride": "inherit",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 5,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# RaiBert cost and usage\nUsage charts: last 24 hours, 5-minute buckets, including partial live data. In the top-right Refresh menu, select **5 Minutes** for regular updates. Gaps mean no published samples, not confirmed zero.\n\nBilling updates only several times daily; dollar widgets show account-wide estimated month-to-date charges over the last 14 days. S3 storage updates daily (last 7 days shown). These AWS schedules cannot be shortened. Usage charts show cost drivers, not dollar estimates. [Cost Explorer](https://console.aws.amazon.com/costmanagement/home#/cost-explorer)\n\n[Analytics](https://console.aws.amazon.com/cloudwatch/home?region=us-east-1#dashboards:name=raibert-prod-usage) | [Operations](https://console.aws.amazon.com/cloudwatch/home?region=us-east-1#dashboards:name=raibert-prod-operations)"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Account estimated month-to-date charges (USD)",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "view": "singleValue",
        "stat": "Maximum",
        "period": 21600,
        "metrics": [
          [
            "AWS/Billing",
            "EstimatedCharges",
            "Currency",
            "USD",
            {}
          ]
        ],
        "setPeriodToTimeRange": false,
        "liveData": true,
        "start": "-P14D"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 5,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Account month-to-date charges by service (USD)",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "stat": "Maximum",
        "period": 21600,
        "metrics": [
          [
            {
              "expression": "SEARCH('{AWS/Billing,Currency,ServiceName} MetricName=\"EstimatedCharges\" Currency=\"USD\"', 'Maximum', 21600)",
              "id": "services"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "liveData": true,
        "start": "-P14D"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 11,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
